##
## NYXUS — live ISO mirrorlist (rev 2026-05-14 r1)
##
## Shipped pre-populated so the live session can `pacman -Sy` immediately
## without the user having to hand-type a Server line. Empty mirrorlist
## was the root cause of "failed to install archlinux database" at
## install time: archinstall + the calamares fallback both rely on a
## working pacman in the live env to bootstrap the new system.
##
## Mirrors picked for global reachability + uptime, not raw speed.
## Replace with a `reflector --country US --latest 20 --sort rate` run
## post-install if you want lower latency.
##

Server = https://geo.mirror.pkgbuild.com/$repo/os/$arch
Server = https://mirrors.kernel.org/archlinux/$repo/os/$arch
Server = https://mirror.rackspace.com/archlinux/$repo/os/$arch
Server = https://mirror.arizona.edu/archlinux/$repo/os/$arch
Server = https://america.mirror.pkgbuild.com/$repo/os/$arch
Server = https://mirrors.mit.edu/archlinux/$repo/os/$arch
